---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from './PageHeader.astro';
import Callout from './Callout.astro';
import PlantUmlDiagram from './PlantUmlDiagram.astro';

interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'id' }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const id = lang === 'id';
---

<DocsLayout title={id ? 'Arsitektur' : 'Architecture'}>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Internals"
    title={id ? 'Arsitektur aplikasi' : 'Application architecture'}
    description={id
      ? 'Wago memakai satu proses Node.js untuk API, dashboard React statis, policy outbound, SQLite durable state, activity log, dan satu koneksi Baileys.'
      : 'Wago uses one Node.js process for the API, static React dashboard, outbound policy, SQLite durable state, activity log, and one Baileys connection.'}
  />

  <PlantUmlDiagram
    file="system-architecture.puml"
    alt="Wago runtime architecture"
    caption={id ? 'Arsitektur runtime production Wago.' : 'Wago production runtime architecture.'}
  />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">Backend</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-9">
    <table class="w-full text-sm">
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#1a1a1a]">
        <tr><td class="py-3 pr-5 text-[#fafafa] font-medium">config/</td><td class="py-3 text-[#a1a1aa]">{id ? 'Environment, runtime paths, App ID, API-key hash, dan validasi production.' : 'Environment parsing, runtime paths, App ID, API-key hash, and production validation.'}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="py-3 pr-5 text-[#fafafa] font-medium">infrastructure/</td><td class="py-3 text-[#a1a1aa]">{id ? 'Koneksi SQLite, schema migration, transaksi, import state JSON lama, logging, dan lifecycle persistence.' : 'SQLite connection, schema migrations, transactions, legacy JSON import, logging, and persistence lifecycle.'}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="py-3 pr-5 text-[#fafafa] font-medium">middleware/</td><td class="py-3 text-[#a1a1aa]">{id ? 'Auth Bearer/cookie, request logging, dan route-level rate limiting.' : 'Bearer/cookie authentication, request logging, and route-level rate limiting.'}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="py-3 pr-5 text-[#fafafa] font-medium">routes/</td><td class="py-3 text-[#a1a1aa]">{id ? 'Kontrak HTTP untuk app, activity, recipients, WhatsApp, dan messages.' : 'HTTP contracts for app, activity, recipients, WhatsApp, and messages.'}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="py-3 pr-5 text-[#fafafa] font-medium">policy/</td><td class="py-3 text-[#a1a1aa]">{id ? 'Consent, opt-out, idempotency, account/recipient/new-chat limits, health checks, dan query safety state langsung ke tabel SQLite terindeks.' : 'Consent, opt-out, idempotency, account/recipient/new-chat limits, account-health checks, and direct safety-state queries against indexed SQLite tables.'}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="py-3 pr-5 text-[#fafafa] font-medium">recipients/</td><td class="py-3 text-[#a1a1aa]">{id ? 'Repository recipient SQLite untuk allow/opt-out, resolved JID, dan successful-outbound history.' : 'SQLite recipient repository for allow/opt-out, resolved JID, and successful-outbound history.'}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="py-3 pr-5 text-[#fafafa] font-medium">activity/</td><td class="py-3 text-[#a1a1aa]">{id ? 'Operator activity log di SQLite, dibatasi 300 event, dengan metadata yang direduksi sebelum persistence.' : 'SQLite-backed operator activity log capped at 300 events with metadata redaction before persistence.'}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="py-3 pr-5 text-[#fafafa] font-medium">whatsapp/</td><td class="py-3 text-[#a1a1aa]">{id ? 'Lifecycle socket, QR, reconnect, binding, account health, recipient resolution, dan message status.' : 'Socket lifecycle, QR, reconnect, binding, account health, recipient resolution, and message status.'}</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">Frontend</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-5">
    {id
      ? 'Frontend React menggunakan API relatif secara default, sehingga build production disajikan oleh Express dari origin yang sama. API key browser disimpan di sessionStorage dan dikirim sebagai Bearer token; request juga menyertakan cookie HttpOnly bootstrap jika tersedia.'
      : 'The React frontend uses a relative API base by default, so Express serves the production build from the same origin. The browser API key is kept in sessionStorage and sent as a Bearer token; requests also include the bootstrap HttpOnly cookie when available.'}
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-9">
    <li>{id ? 'Polling adaptif: 5 detik saat connecting/QR, 15 detik saat disconnected, 30 detik saat connected, dan tidak melakukan request ketika tab tersembunyi.' : 'Adaptive polling: 5 seconds while connecting/QR, 15 seconds while disconnected, 30 seconds while connected, with backend requests paused while the tab is hidden.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Pair WhatsApp dapat melakukan first-run credential bootstrap otomatis sebelum memulai QR pairing.' : 'Pair WhatsApp can perform first-run credential bootstrap automatically before starting QR pairing.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Dashboard mencakup recipient access, manual send, message status, account health, dan activity log.' : 'The dashboard includes recipient access, manual sending, message status, account health, and the activity log.'}</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">{id ? 'Flow bootstrap dan pairing' : 'Bootstrap and pairing flow'}</h2>
  <PlantUmlDiagram
    file="bootstrap-pairing-flow.puml"
    alt="Wago first-run credential bootstrap and WhatsApp pairing flow"
    caption={id ? 'Flow fresh gateway dan gateway yang sudah memiliki credential.' : 'Flow for a fresh gateway and an already-initialized gateway.'}
  />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">{id ? 'Flow outbound message' : 'Outbound message flow'}</h2>
  <PlantUmlDiagram
    file="outbound-message-flow.puml"
    alt="Wago protected outbound text-message flow"
    caption={id ? 'Policy dievaluasi sebelum socket mengirim ke WhatsApp.' : 'Policy is evaluated before the socket sends to WhatsApp.'}
  />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">{id ? 'Persistent vs transient state' : 'Persistent vs transient state'}</h2>
  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
    <div class="border border-[#262626] rounded-lg p-5">
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-[#fafafa] mb-2">Persistent</h3>
      <ul class="text-sm text-[#71717a] space-y-1.5">
        <li><code>/app/data/wago.db</code> — {id ? 'settings, binding, recipients, outbound safety, activity' : 'settings, binding, recipients, outbound safety, activity'}</li>
        <li><code>/app/data/auth/</code> — {id ? 'credential/session Baileys' : 'Baileys credentials/session'}</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-[#262626] rounded-lg p-5">
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-[#fafafa] mb-2">Transient</h3>
      <ul class="text-sm text-[#71717a] space-y-1.5">
        <li>{id ? 'QR dan connection snapshot' : 'QR and connection snapshot'}</li>
        <li>{id ? 'reconnect timer/counter' : 'reconnect timer/counter'}</li>
        <li>{id ? 'account-health cache' : 'account-health cache'}</li>
        <li>{id ? 'message status/recent-message cache' : 'message status/recent-message cache'}</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">SQLite</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-5">
    {id
      ? 'Wago menggunakan node:sqlite bawaan Node.js tanpa ORM atau service database tambahan. Database memakai WAL mode, synchronous=NORMAL, busy timeout 5 detik, prepared statements, migration table, dan indeks untuk window outbound. Idempotency, accepted outbound event, reach-out cooldown, pause state, recipient history, dan activity disimpan sebagai row terstruktur—bukan satu blob policy yang ditulis ulang setiap send.'
      : 'Wago uses Node.js built-in node:sqlite without an ORM or separate database service. The database uses WAL mode, synchronous=NORMAL, a 5-second busy timeout, prepared statements, a migration table, and indexes for outbound windows. Idempotency keys, accepted outbound events, reach-out cooldowns, pause state, recipient history, and activity are stored as structured rows rather than one policy blob rewritten on every send.'}
  </p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Accepted outbound memakai satu transaksi' : 'Accepted outbound uses one transaction'}>
    {id
      ? 'Setelah send diterima Baileys, Wago menambahkan outbound event/idempotency dan memperbarui lastSuccessfulOutboundAt recipient dalam satu transaksi SQLite. Jika salah satu write gagal, seluruh transaksi database di-rollback.'
      : 'After Baileys accepts a send, Wago inserts the outbound event/idempotency state and updates the recipient lastSuccessfulOutboundAt value in one SQLite transaction. If any database write fails, the full database transaction is rolled back.'}
  </Callout>

  <Callout title={id ? 'Skalabilitas sengaja dibatasi' : 'Scaling is intentionally constrained'} tone="warning">
    {id
      ? 'Jangan menjalankan beberapa replica menggunakan /app/data yang sama. Arsitektur ini tetap single-instance dan tidak dirancang untuk horizontal scaling, distributed rate limits, atau multi-session.'
      : 'Do not run multiple replicas against the same /app/data volume. The architecture remains single-instance and is not designed for horizontal scaling, distributed rate limits, or multiple sessions.'}
  </Callout>
</DocsLayout>
